+   "source": [
+    "from pathlib import Path\n",
+    "from importlib import metadata\n",
+    "from tempfile import mkdtemp\n",
+    "import os, sys, subprocess\n",
+    "\n",
+    "needed = {\"numpy\": \"2.3.5\", \"pandas\": \"2.2.3\"}\n",
+    "def local_version(package):\n",
+    "    try:\n",
+    "        return metadata.version(package)\n",
+    "    except metadata.PackageNotFoundError:\n",
+    "        return None\n",
+    "missing = [f\"{k}=={v}\" for k, v in needed.items() if local_version(k) != v]\n",
+    "if missing:\n",
+    "    subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"-q\", *missing])\n",
+    "work = Path(mkdtemp(prefix=\"kelompok9-co-\"))\n",
+    "os.environ[\"OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS\"] = \"1\"\n",
+    "os.environ[\"OMP_NUM_THREADS\"] = \"1\"\n",
+    "print(\"Lingkungan eksperimen siap.\")"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "id": "35793ec7",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "## 2. Implementasi yang digunakan kelompok\n",
+    "Enam modul di bawah menyimpan pembaca data, RNN dengan backpropagation through time, GA/PSO, inferensi fuzzy, pembaca checkpoint, dan prosedur eksperimen di folder sesi. Parameter pencarian dan pembentukan jendela dapat diperiksa langsung."
+   ]
+  },
+  {
